{"title":"Bloodwood Staff","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Bowyer Lv 75)</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Skill needed</h2><p>Any class can cast with a staff, using a spell it has learned. Each school of magic is a skill of its own: see <a href=\"#/guide/magic\">Magic</a> for the schools and where spell scrolls drop.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Bowyer at level 75 <span class=\"muted\">(38995 XP)</span> from 8× <a href=\"#/item/bloodwood-wood\">Bloodwood Wood</a>, 16× <a href=\"#/item/frostwool\">Frostwool</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/bowyer\">Bowyer</a></p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p class=\"rel-row\"><b>Made from</b> <a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/bloodwood-wood\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/gen/c9a448798b51fc7495b2.svg\" alt=\"\">Bloodwood Wood</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/frostwool\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/gen/e624028c088a03d47c1f.svg\" alt=\"\">Frostwool</a></p>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/gen/93d0a58e5998e4981375.svg\" alt=\"Bloodwood Staff\"></div><h3>Bloodwood Staff</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Made with</th><td>Bowyer 75</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </table></aside></article>"}